# API & Data Fetching

- Extend `baseApi` via `injectEndpoints` in `src/store/api/{domain}Api.ts`.
- Types in `src/types/{domain}.ts` — hand-written TS, not Zod for responses.
- Auth: cookie session (`credentials: "include"`); 401 handled in `baseApi` interceptor.
- Use generated hooks (`useXQuery`, `useXMutation`); invalidate with tag types.
- Errors: backend `.data.message` — no toast library; inline UI errors preferred over `alert()`.
- Env: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` only — never commit values.

Details: `/docs/ai-context/06-API-AND-DATA-FETCHING.md`
